Files under other licenses
--------------------------

These two files embed the SafeWebAuthnSignerProxy creation code, compiled from
safe-modules (https://github.com/safe-global/safe-modules, passkey v0.2.1),
which is licensed LGPL-3.0-only. They keep that license:

  apps/signer/SignerKit/Sources/SignerKit/SignerProxy.swift
  contracts/src/PasskeyDeployments.sol

The source files of those contracts and the safe-modules repository LICENSE are
LGPL-3.0; the passkey npm package declares GPL-3.0 instead. We follow the
source-file license for the compiled bytecode.

The bytecode is needed to compute a signer's owner address offline (CREATE2).
Anyone distributing a binary that includes SignerProxy.swift should check the
LGPL-3.0 terms for that file.

